  "worked_solution": "There are $4$ columns in $B$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication, and $BA$ is a $2\\times 6$ matrix:\n\n$$\n{B}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 6}={BA}_{2\\times 6}\n$$",
